{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["מעבר לירדן ירחו — that is, opposite the Jordan and opposite Jericho. Not downstream in the Jordan and not upstream from the inhabitants of the land of Israel. It is appropriate to write מעבר לירדן for those who crossed the Jordan, for to them the steppes of Moab are across the Jordan."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:50:39.754078115Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}